<title>Kuis Konsep Dasar Keperawatan — 100 Soal</title>
<style>
:root{--blue:#1a73e8;--bg:#f0ebf8;--ink:#202124;--muted:#5f6368;--line:#dadce0;--green:#188038;--red:#d93025;--yellow:#f9ab00}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);font:15px/1.55 Arial, sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}
